        <body>
            <div xml:id="d26-a1">

                <pb facs="0117" n="29" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg29"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Soughimoura to
                        Doctor Pardo.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Japan</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-02-11"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February 11,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: In accordance with instructions
                    from my Government, I have the honor to inform your excellency that on the first
                    of the present month His Majesty the Emperor, my august Sovereign, issued a
                    decree declaring war against Russia, and at the same time to express to you that
                    the Government of His Imperial Majesty does not doubt that Peru will maintain
                    strict neutrality, and hopes that the necessary measures will be, taken to make
                    the same effective.</p>
                <p>I take this opportunity, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">K. Soughimoura.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
